      "id": 1044023,
      "name": "[Deployed] Ariel",
      "desc": "Active Skill: Flies high into the air, then blinks to the target's vicinity, attacking and pulling in enemies across a large area. After a short time, a Prismatic Cross is generated that deals <color=#FE437E>Ether DMG</color>. Once the pull ends, gain 1/2/3 random buffs based on the number of enemies pulled (the same buff cannot be gained more than once): Buff 1: Restore the Agent's HP. Buff 2: Restore the Agent's Energy. Buff 3: Increase Prismatic Cross DMG.",
      "desc2": "<color=#FFFFFF>Bangboo Chain Attack: Glides through the air and throws a Dazzling Nebula at the target, dealing massive <color=#FE437E>Ether DMG</color>.</color>",
